  "_doc": "Enemy rows. tier feeds progression; gen names the creature table used by the view. attacks: what it can swing, chosen at random each time from those its weapon allows (arms: scythe | axe | spear | club; Sim.ARMS gives each Trolloc one by id). kind names the motion; height high can be ducked, over (a chop coming down) cannot; arc is the half-angle it covers, fixed when the swing starts, so stepping out of it makes it miss; time, dmg and reach multiply the row's own numbers. ranged: an archer (range it will shoot from, keep = the distance it likes, time between arrows, dmg, arrow speed and gravity). evades: share of blows and weaves a Myrddraal is simply not there for, unless staggered or bound. steady: cannot be knocked down. links: Trollocs that arrive in the same wave die when it dies. fester: its wounds go on hurting (secs, dps) until Healed.",
